📊 Sales Record Dashboard Project
📌 Overview

This project focuses on analyzing sales data and building an interactive dashboard to understand business performance. The goal is to convert raw sales data into meaningful insights that help in better decision-making.

🎯 Objectives
Analyze overall sales and profit performance
Identify top-performing products and categories
Understand regional sales distribution
Track sales trends over time
Build an interactive dashboard for insights
📂 Dataset

The dataset includes the following fields:

Order ID
Order Date
Region
Product Category
Sales Amount
Profit

Files used:

Sales Records.csv
Sales_Record_Cleaned.xlsx
Sales_Record_Dashboard.pbix
🛠️ Tools & Technologies
Power BI – Dashboard creation
Excel – Data cleaning
Python / SQL – Data analysis (optional)
📊 Dashboard Features
Interactive filters (Region, Category, Date)
Sales & Profit visualization
Time-based trend analysis
Top products & categories
Regional performance insights
📊 Reporting & Storytelling
📌 Business Summary

The dashboard provides a complete overview of sales performance by analyzing revenue, profit, product categories, and regional trends. It transforms raw data into actionable insights for business growth.

📖 Key Insights
1️⃣ Sales Performance

Sales show consistent activity with noticeable peaks during certain periods, indicating seasonal demand patterns.

2️⃣ Top Products

A few products contribute the majority of revenue, highlighting the importance of focusing on high-performing items.

3️⃣ Category Analysis

Some categories generate high sales but lower profit, indicating margin issues and the need for pricing or cost optimization.

4️⃣ Regional Performance

Certain regions outperform others, showing strong market presence, while underperforming regions require improvement strategies.

5️⃣ Profit Analysis

High sales do not always mean high profit. Discounts or costs may reduce profitability in some areas.

6️⃣ Time Trends

Sales patterns over months help in identifying peak seasons and planning inventory and marketing strategies.
